i>The Gravity Shift: Weakened gravity and increased verticality tied to the Freedom alignment.</li>\n<li>The Chronos Effect: Time manipulation and predictability mechanics tied to the Order alignment.</li>\n<li>The Entropy Tax: Resource scarcity and exponential power growth tied to the Dominion alignment.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Ludonarrative Harmony</h3>\n<p>The Weight of Choice: Gameplay reinforces themes of Order vs. Freedom and the Corruption of Power by making Dominion an 'easy mode' with social isolation, Freedom a high-risk/unpredictable path, and Order a safe but stagnant experience.</p>\n</div></div><div><div class=\"spinner-border\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Loading...</span></div></div>"